{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "cfeae0e07ab3837b83805f179d4863d9f745954fdd0d70bc82a507d5857d9131", "ja": "リリィ・クエスト ～天空の子豚～ 冒険へ", "zh": "莉莉任务 ～天空小猪～ 前往冒险", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "43387d374b413087a207bb874c90e81b54e0adb082622eab7d26006fc5c119f6", "ja": "まずは装備を整えるため、星梨花と共に隣の\n村を訪れた百合子。難しい言葉を使う村人に\n案内され、武器屋や、村人の家を巡る。タン\nスの中からアイテムをゲットしたふたりは、\nいよいよ本格的に魔王討伐の旅に出発。", "zh": "为了先整顿装备，百合子和星梨花一同造访\n了隔壁的村子。两人在用词晦涩的村民指引\n下，走访了武器店和村民的家。从衣柜中\n获得道具的两人，终于正式踏上了讨伐魔王\n的旅程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "2836e6bc3d16d293ee230ef14363c03b7bfd42c84b60198743f22457bc742f2d", "ja": "―　隣の村　―", "zh": "―　邻村　―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "dbad4c68ef0481e7a74066d69f601046d495a18e76532e5b8586b4b9be3b1212", "ja": "まずはこの村で装備を整えないと。\nまずはあの人に話しかけてみましょう！", "zh": "首先得先在这个村子里整备好装备才行。\n先去跟那个人搭个话吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "d2bf9e334c01fadd90393c47c7e613c33ba0b4abcce3b8d73886e46c596a833c", "ja": "あの、すみません。\n私達、この村が初めてなんですけど……。", "zh": "那个，不好意思。\n我们是第一次来这个村子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "6af4fbb8e1ab67c56b66d5a2c08105aaf2d06f923964107c6791416af5dc3ba0", "ja": "ウェルカムです！　ここはさいはての森の隣の村。\nネクストフォーレストビレッジです！", "zh": "欢迎光临！这里是紧邻边境之森的村子——\n未来森林村！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "4458f10902f964fea1b8fcae5cdc6a391ac0fd55a97c98d50147abb8868621cd", "ja": "ワンランク上のアドバンスドなエクスペリエンスを\nプロミスします！", "zh": "保证带来更上一层楼的高级体验！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "f6b10369ec00801fbb491d4a4d5bcbc6cef706099fc70f0a8db0702ea3c50c2b", "ja": "え、えええっ？　星梨花ちゃん、どうしよう。\nやっぱり都会は使われてる言葉も違うのかなぁ。", "zh": "诶、诶诶诶？星梨花，我们该怎么办呀。果然，城里人用的词也不一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "641f5ae7412ad7f1c9d95108b4881b391538feed15202c59021e13ff687ece94", "ja": "たしかに、ちょっと難しい言葉を使う村人さんです。\nこんな時は……妖精辞典です！", "zh": "确实，这位村民用的词有点难懂。\n这种时候就要靠……妖精辞典！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac46be864740a74a6b11b9f16f1ef366155535a5baf1d2287e67014fb2aa0c3f", "ja": "えっとえっと……わかりました！\nちょっとだけいい宿屋さんに泊まれるみたいです。", "zh": "那个那个……我明白了！好像可以住进稍微好一点的旅店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "6ed87d99a3493a97b2e11aaf18a2965b726066ce3e833aaa0a85799c2dc8ad0c", "ja": "なるほど～。さすが都会の村だねっ！", "zh": "原来如此～不愧是都市里的村子呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "d596e35a29af7467796b975cd48d0354459f9f94b27a55025973be5ba0c673e3", "ja": "そ、そうじゃなくて、ワンランク上のアドバンスドな\nエクスペリエンスをプロミス……。", "zh": "不、不是那样，我是说要承诺给你更上一层楼的先进体验……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "fa53fe12996c5971b0ea0e0c6ab0d4f10c5220690fe0ad9b84c74abb9072fa94", "ja": "それじゃ、とりあえず村の中を回って見てみましょう！", "zh": "那么，我们先在村子里转一转看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "f7a74c10921697fa29d6529b653716d11cbfa49fb748d49889bbcf908bc129fe", "ja": "聞いてくださいってば～！", "zh": "听我说嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1012_null", "source_sha256": "8b6ab47a8c1d167191d296b89c4a2680c322ec9b83d7138ab4ae3b50908b03bc", "ja": "―　武器屋　―", "zh": "―　武器店　―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "15b2b847b4f2bf933e005df978b7d1a9a2d5791f1e6599a6fe46cf29457261a6", "ja": "いらっしゃいませです！", "zh": "欢迎光临！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "96dbf19969997d9eeb4c67c902fb604396270782ecb9011556bd4499e00b7325", "ja": "あれ、さっきの村人さん！", "zh": "咦，这不是刚才那位村民吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "a478e81d8525ba2e5695d9651d9d6182c40f9cee5f0331e34f8994754b31617f", "ja": "ロコはビレッジピーポーじゃないです。\nブラックスミスです！　何かご用件ですか？", "zh": "ROCO不是村民，是铁匠！有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "42da28420620406b0386066957a77a5fa8c90edcaa24aebe23a629210cf742ce", "ja": "アバンギャルドなレジェンドソードをロコメイクで\nお届けしますよ！　なんとたったの10マニーです！", "zh": "用前卫风格的ROCO打造传奇之剑，送到您手上哦！居然只要10玛尼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "54550e6dc32dbb03b09bebbf8a649f40d57a77352b7703798479914063173443", "ja": "今お財布を……1、2、3……大変！\n7マニーしかありませんでした……。", "zh": "我现在看看钱包……1、2、3……糟糕！里面只有7马尼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "577213387c1cdeccc6ce55d481f36d7e8841b3046539df0c5441809b0fce56a1", "ja": "ソーリーです。\nそれではマニーが足りないみたいです。", "zh": "对不起。\n看来玛尼不够呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "618003001bbc40baa46b399fac3eeeb73183819cdb69711c58ca5c3cba3d3323", "ja": "これでも、お小遣い全部持ってきたんだけど。\n星梨花ちゃん、マニー持ってない？", "zh": "即便如此，我还是把全部零花钱都带来了。星梨花，你身上有玛尼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "9f52f8362da49fc3fce2a15f74151401c598b0a9493143507d97aae05391dde2", "ja": "妖精郷ではマニーは使わないんです。ええと……\nミリオネージュ大陸周遊ガイドブックによると……。", "zh": "在妖精乡是不使用玛尼的。那个……\n根据《米利欧涅修大陆周游指南》上说的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "8cbf0bcb99ec88df5a27b5999bb3887c2bce01e443f70fce1f51be09fd3d5573", "ja": "こういう時は、まず村人さんのおうちに\n入れてもらうのがいいみたいです。行ってみましょう！", "zh": "这种时候，看来得先请村民让我们进家里去。我们去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "1015d7525fa483f3e9ca442fd1b79a7d0195022e6b06622658920ef0229301f3", "ja": "……次はビレッジピーポーです。\nよいしょ、よいしょ。", "zh": "……接下来是村民们。\n嘿咻，嘿咻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "339e1ef500fec43239cbf66301697c01a587510b0c963d1e149d7eb01a6718b1", "ja": "誰かいますか？", "zh": "有人在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "3dd7398eeab46dc069f004e63f771e638561b8822ef791fb2d06c16bcec1ba1b", "ja": "ウェルカムです！　今のロコはブラックスミスじゃない\nです。ビレッジピーポーAです！", "zh": "欢迎光临！现在的ROCO不是铁匠。\n而是村民A！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "7415c465b6c6f55c3d9d79adcbe6c6e19456e82929b5bd95a7d7b7d626b41731", "ja": "あ、百合子さん、\nタンスの中に何かあるみたいですよ？", "zh": "啊，百合子小姐，\n衣柜里好像有什么东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "c54ca3e06fd42c604c1f9c2a408edf6cb97cf285d3d874857aa383e7e7ab54c1", "ja": "タンス？\n……硬貨がひとつ。10マニー硬貨ね。", "zh": "衣柜？\n……一枚硬币。是10玛尼硬币呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "ff68e804b4cd0621bbc9a9b98c695476ca8d248380e68f583a33cfca0d6248d2", "ja": "階段の横を探すとバトルキャンディ、その隣の\n壺の中には、スパークドリンクがあるみたいです！", "zh": "在楼梯旁边找到了战斗糖果，旁边的罐子里好像还有闪耀饮料！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "5516f8d7a89d041b0d4824239842870586074f74940cbd7ac755d746eea7efc3", "ja": "……本当だ。\n……これも、私達がもらっちゃっていいのかな？", "zh": "……真的。\n……这个我们也可以拿走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "c49f518f274c83b13004775df91dc89119435134ad2cd7f053c053283bae9d96", "ja": "ああっ！　何してるんですか！？\nそれはロコのアイテムです！　や、やめてください～！", "zh": "啊！你在做什么啊！？\n那是ROCO的道具！请、请住手～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "a1c0b93edab13720a0b0020e275c50b6fc6b9fd7777da68a04129c4cb102d89e", "ja": "ロコさん、ごめんなさい……。代わりに\nわたしの描いた絵をあげますから、許してください！", "zh": "ROCO先生，对不起……。我把自己画的画送给您作为补偿，请原谅我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "6b3b059a00f72821ed8d84580e87aa7d23ce9bbbc08100ae47aded90780b8c5c", "ja": "こ、これは……！　イノセンスであふれたピクチャー\n……セリカアートの一大傑作です！！", "zh": "这、这是……！一幅洋溢着纯真的画作……是星梨花艺术的一大杰作！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "d2d48e7ddacfb570813e899947358aa4b4a0c98e4dd59366a25375cfd68bcee2", "ja": "このアートをくれるならサティスファクションです♪\n見つけたアイテム、持ってっちゃってください♪", "zh": "要是能把这件艺术品送给我，我就满足了♪  \n请把找到的道具拿走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_02_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "48a83423185d2d3db216c7835ed25f045a7cbba03a0a2353eda629b186ea9475", "ja": "ロコちゃん、ありがとう！　私、ロコちゃん達\nみんなの分まで、魔王軍との戦いを頑張ります！", "zh": "ROCO，谢谢你！我会连同ROCO她们的份，为了大家努力战斗，对抗魔王军！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
